  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 77be8d3abc4d614408c62dfb3862c314, type: 3}
  m_Name: J1_Seq1B_II_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpeakerTextSO
  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 1
    text: After their initial disappointment, following the review it is clear to
      the client that had your company not brought some of these items to them at
      this early stage there would have been a significant cost impact to the project
      later. The client is a little frustrated still that it is over budget but is
      generally grateful and excited to start the project. Your Regional Director
      is happy to have secured a higher project value and additional profit upfront.
